# Skyway: night, high above the void, mostly unfenced. Tense E Phrygian over a droning E:
# the clashing F, a creeping chromatic descent, and a tritone that never quite resolves.
# Two A sections, a C Am B lift falling chromatically, then a stripped drone-and-kick section
# climbing chromatically back to the top

